                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.—Received October 1,
                        1900.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-29"><hi rendition="#italic">September 29,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that the Russian legation has to-day been removed to
                    Tientsin.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
